---
/**
 * 📍 文件位置: src/pages/zh/marketplace/index.astro
 * 🌐 路由: /zh/marketplace/
 * 🎯 作用: Marketplace 中文版——信仰与生意信任落地页
 */
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import site from '../../../features/site/site.json';

const waLink = 'https://wa.me/' + String(site.site.whatsapp || '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');
const email = site.site.email || 'pastorjeffinchina@gmail.com';
---

<BaseLayout lang="zh" title="职场见证 — 信仰与工作 | Livingstone" description="广州牧师 Jeff 的职场见证——信仰与工作在同一张办公桌。诚实的报价，守住的承诺。">
  <section class="py-24 lg:py-32 px-6 bg-beige-50 min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-sage-600 font-semibold mb-4">职场事工</p>
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold text-charcoal-900 mb-4">信仰，走进职场</h1>
      <p class="text-charcoal-600 text-lg mb-10">我是广州的一位牧师——工作日里，我在一家工厂上班，和同事打交道、处理外贸订单。两个呼召，同一张办公桌。</p>

      <!-- 我的见证 -->
      <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-beige-200 p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-charcoal-900 mb-4">一扇我没有敲过的门</h2>
        <div class="text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed space-y-4">
          <p>2026 年 7 月，我搬到了广州增城。我在那里是新人，认识的人不多，也还没有开始找工作。</p>
          <p>然后有一天，电话响了。一家做汽车内饰的公司找到了<em>我</em>，说要和我聊聊。我们谈得不错，接着面试，几天后我就入职了。我没有经历漫长的求职——门在我敲之前，就自己开了。</p>
          <p class="border-l-2 border-sage-400 pl-4 italic font-serif text-charcoal-800">「你们要先求他的国和他的义，这些东西都要加给你们了。」——马太福音 6:33</p>
          <p>不是我找到了这家工厂，是神把它给我的。所以我把这份工作看成我的服侍。我的办公室在工厂，不在教堂，但同一位神在两个地方都与我同在。</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/zh/testimonies/2/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 mt-6 text-sage-700 hover:text-sage-800 font-medium text-sm transition-colors">
          阅读我的完整信仰故事
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- 我的工作 -->
      <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-beige-200 p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-charcoal-900 mb-4">我的工作</h2>
        <p class="text-charcoal-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">我工作的地方是广州增城的一家制造工厂。我在那里负责海外订单：报价、打样、跟产、出货。</p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-6">
          <div class="text-center py-3 border border-beige-200 rounded-xl"><div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">20+</div><div class="text-[11px] text-charcoal-400 mt-1">年行业经验</div></div>
          <div class="text-center py-3 border border-beige-200 rounded-xl"><div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">80万㎡</div><div class="text-[11px] text-charcoal-400 mt-1">月产能</div></div>
          <div class="text-center py-3 border border-beige-200 rounded-xl"><div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">30万㎡</div><div class="text-[11px] text-charcoal-400 mt-1">常备现货</div></div>
          <div class="text-center py-3 border border-beige-200 rounded-xl"><div class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-charcoal-900">1000+</div><div class="text-[11px] text-charcoal-400 mt-1">可选颜色</div></div>
        </div>
        <a href="/zh/products/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sage-700 hover:text-sage-800 font-medium text-sm transition-colors">
          逛逛小店
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </article>

      <!-- 我的工作方式 -->
      <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg border border-beige-200 p-8 mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-charcoal-900 mb-6">我做事的方式</h2>
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-sage-100 text-sage-800 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 font-serif font-bold text-sm">1</div>
            <div><p class="font-semibold text-charcoal-800 text-sm">诚实的报价</p><p class="text-charcoal-500 text-sm mt-0.5">我报的价，就是你要付的价。不玩套路，不钓鱼换价。</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-sage-100 text-sage-800 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 font-serif font-bold text-sm">2</div>
            <div><p class="font-semibold text-charcoal-800 text-sm">说话算数</p><p class="text-charcoal-500 text-sm mt-0.5">答应的事，记下来、做到、回报进度。</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-sage-100 text-sage-800 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 font-serif font-bold text-sm">3</div>
            <div><p class="font-semibold text-charcoal-800 text-sm">真实的交期</p><p class="text-charcoal-500 text-sm mt-0.5">现货 5–10 天发货；定制颜色纹理 15–20 天。</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-sage-100 text-sage-800 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 font-serif font-bold text-sm">4</div>
            <div><p class="font-semibold text-charcoal-800 text-sm">主动的售后</p><p class="text-charcoal-500 text-sm mt-0.5">出了问题，我先发现、我先修，不用你催。</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-beige-200">
          <a href="/zh/faq/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sage-700 hover:text-sage-800 font-medium text-sm transition-colors">还有其他问题？查看完整 FAQ <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="bg-charcoal-800 rounded-2xl p-8 text-white">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold mb-2">联系 Jeff。</h2>
        <p class="text-charcoal-200 text-sm mb-6">有任何想聊的——24 小时内回复，通常更快。</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href={waLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-400 text-white font-medium text-sm px-5 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17.472 14.382c-.297-.149-1.758-.867-2.03-.967-.273-.099-.471-.148-.67.15-.197.297-.767.966-.94 1.164-.173.199-.347.223-.644.075-.297-.15-1.255-.463-2.39-1.475-.883-.788-1.48-1.761-1.653-2.059-.173-.297-.018-.458.13-.606.134-.133.297-.347.446-.52.149-.174.198-.298.297-.497.1-.198.05-.371-.025-.52-.075-.149-.669-1.612-.916-2.207-.242-.579-.487-.5-.669-.51-.173-.008-.371-.01-.57-.01-.198 0-.52.074-.792.372-.272.297-1.04 1.016-1.04 2.479 0 1.462 1.065 2.875 1.213 3.074.149.198 2.096 3.2 5.077 4.487.709.306 1.262.489 1.694.625.712.227 1.36.195 1.871.118.571-.085 1.758-.719 2.006-1.413.248-.694.248-1.289.173-1.413-.074-.124-.272-.198-.57-.347m-5.421 7.403h-.004a9.87 9.87 0 01-5.031-1.378l-.361-.214-3.741.982.998-3.648-.235-.374a9.86 9.86 0 01-1.51-5.26c.001-5.45 4.436-9.884 9.888-9.884 2.64 0 5.122 1.03 6.988 2.898a9.825 9.825 0 012.893 6.994c-.003 5.45-4.437 9.885-9.885 9.885m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413z"/></svg>
            WhatsApp 联系 Jeff
          </a>
          <a href={'mailto:' + email + '?subject=你好（来自网站）'} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-charcoal-500 hover:border-charcoal-300 text-charcoal-100 font-medium text-sm px-5 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors">
            {email}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
